# No browser testing

Do not open, navigate, screenshot, or otherwise verify this game in the browser.

The user tests UI and gameplay themselves and will report back. Skip browser tools, browser MCP, and any substitute "open the app and click around" workflow.

Only use the browser if the user explicitly asks for it in that message.
